&lt;p&gt;Hi, I&amp;rsquo;m Pippin. I make &lt;a href="https://pippinbarr.github.io/games/"&gt;games&lt;/a&gt;. I&amp;rsquo;m kind of on &lt;a href="https://bsky.app/profile/pippinbarr.bsky.social"&gt;Bluesky&lt;/a&gt;, and definitely on &lt;a href="mailto:pippin.barr@gmail.com"&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;. If you want to stay up to date, you could &lt;a href="https://pippin-barr.kit.com/"&gt;subscribe to my newsletter&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m an Associate Professor in the &lt;a href="http://www.concordia.ca/finearts/design.html"&gt;Department of Design and Computation Arts&lt;/a&gt; at &lt;a href="http://www.concordia.ca/"&gt;Concordia University&lt;/a&gt; in Montréal. I&amp;rsquo;m a member of the &lt;a href="http://tag.hexagram.ca/"&gt;Technoculture, Art, and Games (TAG) Research Centre&lt;/a&gt;, part of the &lt;a href="http://milieux.concordia.ca/"&gt;Milieux Institute for Arts, Culture, and Technology&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>